p eating so much if you want to feel healthy.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: For sure. I'm going to have to eat more nutritious foods to not gain any more weight. I even used to be vegetarian. Now I like meat.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: And you don't have to eat just a little bit or eat only salads. You've just gotta make better choices in what you consume.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: Hmmm, tell me more.", "id": 2, "time": "12200", "image": "engenn6le03ob10re2img06.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: You see, you've got to eat foods with protein and fiber to keep you full longer. Reduce your calories to 1500, and have a good portion of fruits and veggies with every meal. Some have good antioxidants too.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: So, I can still ingest exciting foods.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Yeah, and desserts aren't against the law. Just watch your portions.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: Alright. I'll commence on the journey tomorrow.", "id": 3, "time": "34200", "image": "engenn6le03ob10re2img02.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn6le03ob10re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn6le03ob10re2img06.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}